 ('Reading · A lecture transcript',text('Lecture: Reading the Clues of an Election',['Look at the data. Turnout fell in the north, so many people **must have stayed** at home, perhaps because of the storm. In the south, turnout rose, so the campaign **must have worked**. The challenger **can’t have won** on policy alone: her messages were vague. And the incumbent **can’t have been** surprised, since polls showed it was close.','**Nobody can say** for sure, but clues help us **work out** what happened.'],kicker='LECTURE',by='Prof. Salgado',gloss=[('incumbent','titular do cargo'),('challenger','desafiante'),('vague','vago'),('poll','pesquisa de opinião')])),
 [('Turnout rose in the south.','T','rose.'),('The lecturer is sure the challenger won on policy.','F','can’t have won on policy alone.'),('The incumbent can’t have been surprised.','T','polls showed.')],
 [('“incumbent” = ?',['titular do cargo','incômodo','inocente'],0,'incumbent.'),('“vague” = ?',['vago','vaga','vingar'],0,'vague.')],
 G('Dedução sobre o passado — uso',['Pista','Dedução'],[['turnout fell','**must have stayed** at home'],['turnout rose','the campaign **must have worked**'],['vague messages','she **can’t have won** on policy'],['polls showed close','he **can’t have been** surprised']],'Use **must have** quando a pista **leva** a uma conclusão positiva; **can’t have** quando **exclui** uma possibilidade. Para suspeitas mais fracas, use **might/could have**.'),
 [('Many people ___ have stayed at home. (must)','must','must have.',None),('The campaign must have ___ . (work, part.)','worked','particípio.',None),('She ___ have won on policy alone. (can’t)','can’t','can’t have.',None),('Clues help us ___ out what happened. (work)','work','work out.',None)],
 V('turnout drop=queda de comparecimento|northern district=distrito do norte|storm effect=efeito da tempestade|vague message=mensagem vaga|campaign effect=efeito da campanha|incumbent advantage=vantagem do titular|poll lead=vantagem nas pesquisas|margin of error=margem de erro|swing vote=voto decisivo|election data=dados eleitorais|regional breakdown=detalhamento regional|southern surge=aumento no sul|policy appeal=apelo de política|challenger’s platform=plataforma da desafiante|vote share=percentual de votos|turnout map=mapa de comparecimento|data clue=pista dos dados|post-election analysis=análise pós-eleição|political scientist=cientista político|lecture slide=slide de aula|rain delay=atraso por chuva|late surge=arrancada final|exit-poll finding=achado de pesquisa de boca de urna|candidate debate=debate de candidatos|messaging strategy=estratégia de mensagem|inference from data=inferência a partir de dados|close contest=disputa apertada|upset win=vitória surpreendente'),
